Expressions of colour 👁️
I can’t imagine a world without this abundance of shades, vibrancy and aliveness.

There’s something about absorbing the show that the world puts on for us every day. Noticing the subtleties, as well as the more obvious sunsets, is something that gives me so much energy.

A reminder that there is so much to experience when we take a moment to really see, and it’s up to us to just notice ✨

